license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-08-23
repository-code: "https://github.com/brandonlign/orbittrace"
abstract: >-
  OrbitTrace is a reproducibility package for the analyses of a
  recurrent late-April meteor-stream candidate in Global Meteor Network
  trajectories. It includes the versioned derived data, final ACRF
  implementation, comparator summaries, and figure-generation scripts. Source
  archive locations and acquisition details are documented separately.
keywords:
  - meteors
  - meteor streams
  - Global Meteor Network
  - reproducibility
